Cell["Level 2 & 1 Constraints", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8a50b0da-829f-4c92-99ea-cef86b588962"],

Cell["\<\
Select independent linear equations at levels 2 and 1. 
Substitute their solutions and extract the common spectral factor. 
The correlator relations have already been imposed above.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9979015303716793`*^9, 
