  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "5"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"dbe5661c-6f62-4910-bb55-1f5ec1797073"],
 ". It has degree 8 in z and depends on five correlator moduli. The cubic \
parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["t", "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "69bba507-0441-4b52-a4d2-1e75616b07b8"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["t", "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "81b95d28-8521-4ab8-8553-b40fb299d063"],
 " are nonzero; all potential parameters remain symbolic."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"249cbef3-35c1-4dfa-8926-a68900321425"],

